'''Cat Kart P''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Cat Kart Awakens!]] It was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Cat Kart P
|image = E 344.png
|appearance = [[Cat Kart Awakens!]]
|money drop = 960¢ - 3,792¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high HP and a very powerful, non-stop attack. She attacks 3 times per animation, but has Single Target attack and many knockbacks which is similar to [[Cala Maria]]. Her immense power can be approached by spamming meatshields in [[Kartopia (Insane)]], since she'll kill your meatshields, make [[Dober P.D]] miss his attacks, and they will also prevent her from killing your heavy hitters.

